  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: authlib 1.9.0+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released authlib 1.9.0+rhlw.1 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2026-114616: Authlib accepts an empty HMAC key, allowing JWS/JWT signature forgery (HS256/HS384/HS512)\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for authlib 1.9.0 from PyPI.",
